cff-version: 1.2.0
message: |
  If you use this software or the Classroom Distraction Evaluation
  Dataset (CDED-7), please cite both the PeerJ Computer Science
  manuscript and the Zenodo Concept DOI 10.5281/zenodo.21206958
  (https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.21206958), which always resolves
  to the latest archived version of the dataset. The current
  latest version is v2 (DOI 10.5281/zenodo.21207208,
  https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.21207208, 129.8 MB) and contains
  the seven raw evaluation videos. The dataset is released for
  research and non-commercial use only; see DATASET_LICENSE.md.
title: "Classroom Distraction Estimation via Tracking-to-Analysis Continuity"
type: software
